# Keep build context small and, above all, keep secrets and dev artifacts out
# of the image. The Administrator password lives outside the app (see
# docker/README-docker.md) and is never copied here.
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/node_modules
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.admin_password
**/sites
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
